  "description": "Get a little more with a 24. The DMC 24\" celebrates the life and BMX times of Dennis McCoy with an upsized aluminum twin-tube Master frame and 24\" wheels. Built out with a chromoly fork and Freestyler bars, all sealed bearings and classy details like high-flange hubs, a Lineage top load stem and a custom DMC padded seat. Big enough for cruising in comfort, small enough for EZ action at the skatepark, pump track or dirt jumps.\n6061-T6 heat-treated aluminum frame w/integrated head tube, mid BB, V-brake mounts.\n100% chromoly fork with internally threaded 1-piece CNC steer tube, tapered legs\nHaro Baseline 3-pc chromoly 175mm crank. 39T alloy chainring\nPoly Platform pedals, chromoly 9/16\" Axle\nHaro Freestyler chromoly 7\" rise bars\n36 hole double wall alloy rims with high flange sealed hubs\nHaro DMC railed seat\nHaro Lineage CNC stem. 52mm reach\nHaro Team Grips\nProMax V-brake and lever",
